Z||000000||Homicidal||01-25-2001||10:04 PM||||All I know is, every time I get "Automobile" in the mail, some new wretched mass of metal is on the front.<P>But seriously, cars seem to be getting uglier by the year.<P>The Civic has turned into an angular abomination.<P>With our very own Pontiac putting out those horrendous beasts like the Aztec and soon-to-be sister, Vibe, it's scary!<P>And now I see a few new ones:  <BR>The VW Microbus looks like micro machine.<BR>The Nissan Z is a virtual rolling dome.<BR>And worst of them all, the new Willy's by Chrysler.  Ugh, that thing is just..........UGH!<P>I see they are leaning towards a more "spacey" look, almost like something out of Demolition Man or something.  But this quasi-futuristic stuff has to stop and someone needs to make a REAL car!  Not these toys.||||reg||9
