Z||000018||fierosound||01-27-2001||01:12 PM||||All the newest offering an concepy vehicles can be seen at  <A HREF="http://www.thecarconnection.com/index.asp?n=156,176&sid=176" TARGET=_blank>http://www.thecarconnection.com/index.asp?n=156,176&sid=176</A> <P>I agree that some of the newer cars have "WHAT WERE THEY THINKING (smoking)?" styling.  Others are boxy copies of competitors cars.  The new Nissan Z car looks similer to the Audi TT, but boxier with an ugly frontend.  The ugliest of the bunch seem to be "hybreds".  <P>Imagine the phrases "300-hp, turbocharged, no-compromise sports car" and "all-wheel drive compact sports utility vehicle" in the same sentence, referring to the same vehicle.  You end up with something like the Jalapena - or uglier.  It seems many manufacturers have something in the works.  If you think the Aztek was ugly... just wait...||||reg||10
